WEBVTT

00:11:27.596 --> 00:11:31.436
is why do you think exactly
did this ichthyosaur get so much interest?

00:11:33.276 --> 00:11:34.756
First of all,

00:11:34.796 --> 00:11:36.836
everybody loves a cool fossil,

00:11:36.876 --> 00:11:39.716
especially when it's big
and it's complete.

00:11:39.716 --> 00:11:41.516
So you've got a massive tick there.

00:11:42.116 --> 00:11:46.316
But genuinely, this ichthyosaur
was an apex predator

00:11:46.316 --> 00:11:50.156
at the very top of its food chain
in the Jurassic sea.

00:11:50.196 --> 00:11:51.636
So again, another big tick.

00:11:51.676 --> 00:11:54.756
And admittedly
the photograph is very cool,

00:11:54.796 --> 00:11:56.876
although it is me again laying down.

00:11:56.876 --> 00:11:58.436
(Laughter)

00:11:58.476 --> 00:12:01.156
But on top of that, one thing
it's important to highlight